          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='16'>How to read this chart?</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Each entity is represented by a bar divided into three sections. The percentage of each section represents the proportion of vendors within that entity exhibiting an Underperforming, Neutral, or Overperforming performance in the SFTP Score.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
