                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='16'>How to read this Chart?</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Each column represents a period (week, month, or quarter) depending on the chosen granularity of the selected metric (Metrics Card Filter). When a period is clicked, it turns purple, and all the cards in the first row are calculated based on the selected period.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
