            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8' italic='true'>Note: For a detailed explanation of the &apos;SFTP Score&apos; and how it is calculated, you can click on the icon located in the top right corner of this dashboard. </run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='7200' hidden-by-user='true' id='975' type-v2='text' w='31324' x='65221' y='25300'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='16'>How to read this Chart?</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Each column represents a period (week, month, or quarter) depending on the chosen granularity of the selected metric (Metrics Filter). When a period is clicked, it turns purple, and all the cards in the first row are calculated based on the selected period.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
